      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Circa. 3.5 Acre Development Site | Full Planning Permission for 3 x 4-Bedroom Homes | Shannon Estuary Views. POA.\r\n\r\nSinead Coughlan Estate Agent is delighted to present this exceptional development opportunity in the heart of Loughill Village, West Limerick.\r\nExtending to approximately 3.5 Acres, this impressive site has Full Planning Permission in place for the development of three individual two-storey, four-bedroom residences, each house size is (212m2) designed with a contemporary open-plan living concept. There is NO occupancy Clause.\r\nSet on an elevated position, the site enjoys wonderful views over the Shannon Estuary, creating an attractive setting for these thoughtfully designed  homes. This sites comes Shovel ready, with footpaths, public lighting, and 3 no. individual entrances already in place, each plot is 1 acre or more.   \r\n\r\nThe site is conveniently located directly opposite Gerald Griffin National School in Loughill Village, making this an especially attractive location for families.\r\nLoughill is situated along the Wild Atlantic Way, positioned between the renowned village of Foynes, home to the Port of Foynes, and the picturesque village of Glin.\r\nThe Foynes to Limerick Dual Carriageway is under construction and its a mere 10 minute drive to Tarbert Killimer Ferry and 30 minutes to Ballybunnion-renowned seaside town."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The Development and The planning permission provides for:\r\n\r\nThree individual 4-bedroom, two-storey dwellings\r\nApproximately 3.5 acres of land\r\nFull Planning Permission in place \r\nContemporary open-plan design each house measures 212 m2\r\nElevated setting with views over the Shannon Estuary\r\nEach residence designed to provide generous modern family accommodation\r\nExcellent village location with immediate access to local amenities\r\nPrime West Limerick Location"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Foynes travel the N69 to Loughill Village to Eircode  V94 EK19, This eircode is for Gerald Griffen Nation School, and the development land is across from the School."
      },
      {
